    "body": "Brought up to date with `main` (575f02d8, #839 merged). Head is now `f7124d38`; still a draft.\n\n- Merged `origin/main` (no rebase). One conflict, `crates/app/src/commands/update_model.rs`: both sides added fields and a builder to `UpdateModel` (#826's plate snapshot / `keeping_plate`, this PR's fidelity fields / `with_fidelity` / `keeping_fidelity`). Both kept; `apply` and `invert` write both. `section.rs` merged clean with `main`'s union arc reading and the `model_excess` floor.\n- New pin `verify_arc_reading::boundary_mode_judges_the_union_joints_against_the_tightened_floor`; #839's `boundary_mode_keeps_the_old_joints_so_a_sharp_vertex_on_one_stays_convicted` still passes.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`: sim, motion and app suites green (18 + 16 + 208 binaries); ui suites 11 green, 1 red: `theme_files::the_shipped_example_parses`, which is red on `main` since #767 (#932) and is not touched here.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-sim --tests`: 431 passed, 0 failed. Clippy `-D warnings` clean on sim, app, ui, motion.\n",
