    "body": "Final head of this round: `215da948` (supersedes my comment on `f7124d38`). Still a draft.\n\n`main` moved twice while the gate ran, so there are three merges of `origin/main` (575f02d8, 60057449, 2437098f):\n- `update_model.rs`: #826's plate snapshot and this PR's fidelity fields were both added to `UpdateModel`; both kept.\n- `generate.rs`, the two `contain_into` calls: #843's `cutter` argument and this PR's trailing `material.excess`; both kept. #843's two new test contexts take `..Default::default()`.\n- `section.rs` merged clean (union arc reading + `model_excess` floor); pinned together by `verify_arc_reading::boundary_mode_judges_the_union_joints_against_the_tightened_floor`.\n- The third merge was clean and brings #933, so `theme_files::the_shipped_example_parses` (red on `main` at the earlier heads, #932) is green again.\n\nOn `215da948`: `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main` green (4 steps, 256 test binaries, 0 failed, 20.9 min); `cargo test -p camcraft-sim --tests` 431 passed, 0 failed; clippy `-D warnings` clean on sim, app, ui, motion.\n",
