    "body": "Updated to `main` at v0.18.0 (e0cb0049). Head is now `6a40e3b6`; still a draft.\n\n- The merge had **no conflict**. `section.rs` merged clean with the joint-union reading, #942's whole-arc reading and the `model_excess` tightening all present. The whole-arc reading takes the same `floor` as the joints, so it is tightened too; no code change was needed.\n- New pin beside the #942 suite: `boundary_arc_walls::the_whole_arc_reading_answers_to_a_coarse_models_tightened_floor`. That suite's context (new on main) takes `..Default::default()` for `model_excess`.\n- `Cargo.toml` / `Cargo.lock` are main's 0.18.0; `docs/decisions/864-reduced-fidelity.md` is still in `docs/decisions/`.\n- On `6a40e3b6`: `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main` green (4 steps, 257 test binaries, 0 failed, 21.3 min); `cargo test -p camcraft-sim --tests` 432 passed, 0 failed; clippy `-D warnings` clean on sim, app, ui, motion.\n",
